---
import SiteLayout from '../layouts/SiteLayout.astro'
---
<SiteLayout title="Experiments · Marici" description="Interactive Marici research diagrams and typed visualizations.">
  <section class="page-shell">
    <header class="page-intro">
      <p class="eyebrow">Interactive diagrams</p>
      <h1>Experiments</h1>
      <p>Visual projections of active Marici architectures. Each page states which cells are constructed, candidate, or required.</p>
    </header>
    <div class="experiment-grid">
      <a class="experiment-card" href="/experiments/typed-reconciler-cube/">
        <span>Active candidate · schema visualization</span>
        <h2>Typed reconciler cube</h2>
        <p>Eight tower rungs and recursively assembled comparison cells. Dashed cells remain obligations; the display is not a theorem certificate.</p>
      </a>
      <a class="experiment-card" href="/experiments/tower-cotower-tetrahedron/">
        <span>Active candidate · incomplete filler</span>
        <h2>Tower–cotower tetrahedron</h2>
        <p>Opposite realization and response towers with a required, unconstructed tetrahedral filler.</p>
      </a>
      <a class="experiment-card" href="/experiments/variance-aware-evaluation-complex/">
        <span>Active candidate · variance model</span>
        <h2>Evaluation complex</h2>
        <p>Positive and negative variance sheets with required higher witnesses. It models typing, not contractibility or physical realization.</p>
      </a>
      <a class="experiment-card" href="/experiments/eight-node-coherence-pyramid/">
        <span>Historical · combinatorial explorer</span>
        <h2>Eight-node coherence pyramid</h2>
        <p>The seventh edgewise tetrahedral lattice retained as a historical wire-frame visualization; it carries no current bulk-filler claim.</p>
      </a>
    </div>
  </section>
</SiteLayout>
<style>
  .page-shell{width:min(1120px,calc(100% - 36px));margin:0 auto;padding:64px 0 90px}.page-intro{max-width:720px}.eyebrow,.experiment-card>span{text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.12em;font-size:.72rem;color:#79c8e8}.page-intro h1{font-size:clamp(2.6rem,7vw,5rem);margin:.15em 0}.page-intro>p:last-child{color:#9db0b9;line-height:1.65}.experiment-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(280px,1fr));gap:18px;margin-top:42px}.experiment-card{display:block;padding:24px;border:1px solid #29414c;border-radius:14px;background:#0a161d;color:inherit;text-decoration:none;transition:.18s transform,.18s border-color}.experiment-card:hover{transform:translateY(-3px);border-color:#79c8e8}.experiment-card h2{margin:.45em 0;font-size:1.45rem}.experiment-card p{color:#9db0b9;line-height:1.55;margin:0}
</style>
